<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/transfer-of-training> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "Addresses how prior learning influences later performance and acquisition of skills." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/transfer-of-training/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/transfer-of-training> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/fieldCollection> <https://id.i2idl.org/collections/field/learning-sciences> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/transfer-of-training/versions/1> .
